   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the penal law, in relation to making technical corrections to\nthe definition of the weapon designated as a \"throwing star\" or \"shuriken\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S8934",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8934-2023",
    "coSponsors": {
     "items": [],
     "size": 0
    },
    "fullText": "",
    "fullTextFormats": [],
    "fullTextHtml": "",
    "fullTextTemplate": "",
    "lawCode": "Amd §§265.00, 120.55, 265.01 & 265.10, Pen L",
    "lawSection": "Penal Law",
    "memo": " \nBILL NUMBER: S8934\n\nSPONSOR: CHU\n \nTITLE OF BILL:\n\nAn act to amend the penal law, in relation to making technical\ncorrections to the definition of the weapon designated as a \"throwing\nstar\" or \"shuriken\"\n\n \nPURPOSE:\n\nAN ACT to amend the penal law, in relation to making technical\ncorrections to the definition of the weapon designed as a \"throwing\nstar\" or \"shuriken\"\n\n \nSUMMARY OF PROVISIONS:\n\nSection 1 amends subdivision 15-b of section 265.00 o the penal law, to\nrectify \"Kung Fu star\" to now be \"Throwing Star\" or \"Shuriken\" and adds\na sentence in the definition acknowledging its prior usage as an\noutdated term.\n\nSection 2 amends chapter 257 of Subdivision 1 of Section 120.55 of the\npenal law, to replace the word \"Kung fu star\" with \"throwing star\"\n\nSection 3 amends chapter 34 of Subdivision 1 of section 265.01 of the\npenal law, to replace the word \"Kung Fu star\" with \"throwing star\"\n\nSection 4 amend chapter 34, 130, and 146 of Subdivisions 1 and 2 od\nsection 265.10 of the penal law, to replace the word \"Kung Fu star\" with\n\"throwing star\"\n\n \nJUSTIFICATION:\n\nThis bill updates inaccurate names to a weapon under NYS Penal Law to\ncorrectly reflect the country of its origin. As Japan and China are\ndifferent countries, it is appropriate that NYS Penal Law should reflect\nthe name of this weapon accurately. The weapon in question does not\noriginate from China as implied in the term \"Kung Fu.\"\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nNone\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis bill shall take effect immediately.\n",
